{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/023-ye-you-si-jun/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/023-ye-you-si-jun/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 野有死麕 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 野有死麕 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《野有死麕》的 2 条注释，含 2 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"023-ye-you-si-jun","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/023-ye-you-si-jun/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"023-ye-you-si-jun","title":"野有死麕","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","野有死麕"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"野有死麕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"白茅包之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"有女怀春","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"吉士诱之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"林有朴樕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"野有死鹿","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"白茅纯束","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"有女如玉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"舒而脱脱兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"无感我帨兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"无使尨也吠","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《野有死麕》韵读总说","targetNotes":"书页 148 下半起的诗号 23 段。","sourceLabel":"第 148 页局部","sourceNotes":"书页 148 下半起《野有死麕》韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"王力将《野有死麕》读作三章三势：首章“麕(kyuan)”与“春(thjuən)”为真部本韵，并以“包(pəu)”“诱(tjiu)”作隔句协；次章“樕(sok)”“鹿(lok)”同属屋部，而“束(sjiok)”“玉(ngiok)”另归沃、屋通押；第三章则见“脱(thuat)”“帨(sjuiat)”“吠(biuat)”三字转韵。全篇在王力系统中用韵最灵动。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"野有死麕，白茅包之。有女怀春，吉士诱之。林有朴樕，野有死鹿。白茅纯束，有女如玉。舒而脱脱兮，无感我帨兮，无使尨也吠。","targetNotes":"现存页图可见全篇。","sourceLabel":"第 148 页局部","sourceNotes":"书页 148 下半可见《野有死麕》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"页图可读首章以“麕(kyuan)、春(thjuən)”为真部主韵，并旁协“包(pəu)、诱(tjiu)”；次章“樕(sok)、鹿(lok)、束(sjiok)、玉(ngiok)”由屋沃通押；第三章“脱(thuat)、帨(sjuiat)、吠(biuat)”另成一转。王力据此显出此诗句式和用韵都偏活泼跳宕。","notes":null}]}]}}}
